[8959]=[=[{o="Return to Deliana in Ironforge with a set of Boots of Valor, Legplates of Valor and Spaulders of Valor.",d="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet.  In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us.\n\nThe only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the medallion back together.  Return to Deliana and tell her that Bodley is her only hope for finding the remaining pieces.  Speak to her about any rewards you've arranged for.\n\nI, for once, shall rest in peace.  I wish you the best of luck; you shall need every bit of it!",p="You're back, <name>. You must tell me all about what you've found out. But first let us arrange for your reward.",c="I can't believe our lives are all but forfeit all because of a stupid medallion! And you're sure Anthion mentioned Bodley?\n\nWell, you've done your job so let's get your reward out of the way.",r={it={{21995,1,"Boots of Heroism",4,"inv_boots_plate_03"},{22000,1,"Legplates of Heroism",3,"inv_pants_04"},{22001,1,"Spaulders of Heroism",3,"inv_shoulder_30"}},xp=19900},k=true}]=],
[8960]=[=[{o="Travel to Blackrock Mountain and use the Extra-Dimensional Ghost Revealer to find Bodley near Blackrock Spire.",d="So we need to recover the rest of the medallion?  Finding Bodley's going to be a bit of a headache.  He went back to Blackrock Mountain to attempt to re-enter Blackrock Spire and never came back.\n\nI'd suggest taking the goblin's ghost revealing device with you, as I fear the worst might have happened.",c="I am so glad that you can see me. Finally someone to talk to!\n\nWill you help us, <name>? Help to undo the wrong that we perpetrated and put things to right? If it's true that you already have the Top Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet, then I think I can point you in the right direction to acquire the other two parts, reunite them and put an end to all of this.\n\nOh, by the way, hello, my name is Bodley. Nice to meet you!",r={xp=1650},k=true}]=],
[8961]=[=[{o="Gather the Incendicite of Incendius, the Ember of Emberseer and the Ash of Asharell, along with a Hallowed Brazier, and return them to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain.",r={m=19800,xp=6600},k=false}]=],
[8962]=[=[{o="Acquire Druidical Remains and return them to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain.",d="<class>, listen closely. Now that we have the brazier, and the means to light it, we still need another component to suffuse it with; something that will provide a focus strong enough to entice the spirit of my deceased, former comrade.\n\nMor Grayhoof, our most prominent druid, had many close friends amongst the Cenarion Circle, some of which have fallen to the silithid. I need you to retrieve some Druidical Remains from the silithid that inhabit the environs of Hive'Regal in southeastern Silithus.",p="Have you returned already then, <class>, with what I sent you out to gather?",c="A job well done, <name>. I will imbue the essence of the remains into the brazier.\n\nNow all that is left is to go to the lower portion of Blackrock Spire, to the chamber where War Master Voone resides in Tazz'Alaor, and use the brazier to summon forth the corrupted spirit of my former cohort, Mor Grayhoof. He cannot rest until the amulet piece is taken from him.",r={m=19800,xp=6600},k=true}]=],
[8963]=[=[{o="Acquire a Starbreeze Village Relic and return it to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain.",d="<class>, listen closely. Now that we have the brazier, and the means to light it, we still need another component to suffuse it with; something that will provide a focus strong enough to entice the spirit of my deceased, former comrade.\n\nIsalien, our priestess, grew up in Winterspring at Starbreeze Village. I need you to gather a Starbreeze Village Relic from the Frostmaul giants of Frostwhisper Gorge in southern Winterspring, who are known for raiding to the north from time to time.",p="Have you returned already then, <class>, with what I sent you out to gather?",c="A job well done, <name>. I will imbue the essence of the relic into the brazier.\n\nNow all that is left is to go to the Shrine of Eldretharr in the east wing of Dire Maul, and use the brazier to summon forth the spirit of my former cohort, Isalien. Her spirit has been corrupted by her possession of the piece of Valthalak's amulet, and the portion of his soul within it.",r={m=19800,xp=6600},k=true}]=],
[8964]=[=[{o="Retrieve a Brilliant Sword of Zealotry and return it to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain.",d="<class>, listen closely. Now that we have the brazier, and the means to light it, we still need another component to suffuse it with; something that will provide a focus strong enough to summon the remains of my deceased, former comrades.\n\nThe siblings, Jarien and Sothos, were believers in the way of the Scarlet Crusade. They aspired to knighthood within that vile organization. Go to Tyr's Hand in Eastern Plaguelands and retrieve a Brilliant Sword of Zealotry from the praetorians there.",p="Have you returned already then, <class>, with what I sent you out to gather?",c="A job well done, <name>. I will imbue the essence of the sword into the brazier.\n\nNow all that is left is to get into The Crimson Throne inside The Scarlet Bastion at Stratholme, and use the brazier to summon forth the remains of my former cohorts, Jarien and Sothos. Their souls have been twisted further by their possession of Valthalak's amulet piece and his spirit within.",r={m=19800,xp=6600},k=true}]=],
[8965]=[=[{o="Obtain Soul Ashes of the Banished and return them to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain.",d="<class>, listen closely. Now that we have the brazier, and the means to light it, we still need another component to suffuse it with; something that will provide a focus strong enough to entice the spirit of my deceased, former comrade.\n\nAn ogre necromancer that traveled with us, Kormok, delighted in summoning forth the souls of the banished dead of Purgation Isle, off the south coast of the Hillsbrad Foothills. Go there and retrieve some Soul Ashes of the Banished from their remains.",p="Have you returned already then, <class>, with what I sent you out to gather?",c="A job well done, <name>. I will imbue the essence of the ashes into the brazier.\n\nNow all that is left is to get into Scholomance, to Ras Frostwhisper's chamber, and use the brazier to summon forth the spirit of my former cohort, Kormok. The amulet piece, and Valthalak's spirit within, has corrupted him even further, and he will not rest until you forcibly take it from him.",r={m=19800,xp=6600},k=true}]=],
[8977]=[=[{o="Bring the Extra-Dimensional Ghost Revealer  to Deliana in Ironforge.",d="It's been great working with you, <name>.  Here is the finished product.\n\nI hope it helps you in your current endeavors.  And hey, if you don't mind, help spread the word.  I wouldn't mind having more customers!",p="You've returned?",c="Excellent! You've done well, <name>. I'm not sure I trust the goblin's craftsmanship, but I'm left with no other choice.",r={m=19800,xp=6600},k=true}]=],
[8985]=[=[{o="Acquire a Starbreeze Village Relic and return it to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain.",d="<class>, listen closely. Now that we have the location of the last amulet piece, we still need another component to suffuse the brazier with; something that will provide a focus strong enough to entice the spirit of my deceased, former comrade.\n\nIsalien, our priestess, grew up in Winterspring at Starbreeze Village. I need you to gather a Starbreeze Village Relic from the Frostmaul giants of Frostwhisper Gorge in southern Winterspring, who are known for raiding to the north from time to time.",p="Have you returned already then, <class>, with what I sent you out to gather?",c="A job well done, <name>. I will imbue the essence of the relic into the brazier.\n\nNow all that is left is to go to the Shrine of Eldretharr in the east wing of Dire Maul, and use the brazier to summon forth the spirit of my former cohort, Isalien. Her spirit has been corrupted by her possession of the piece of Valthalak's amulet, and the portion of his soul within it.\n\nOh, by the way, I had some leftover bloodkelp from your trip to Alcaz Isle, so I made it into some potions for you. Take your pick!",r={ch={{22192,3,"Bloodkelp Elixir of Dodging",1,"inv_potion_52"},{22193,3,"Bloodkelp Elixir of Resistance",1,"inv_potion_21"}},xp=6600},k=true}]=],
[8986]=[=[{o="Acquire Druidical Remains and return them to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain.",d="<class>, listen closely. Now that we have the location of the last amulet piece, we still need another component to suffuse the brazier with; something that will provide a focus strong enough to entice the spirit of my deceased, former comrade.\n\nMor Grayhoof, our most prominent druid, had many close friends amongst the Cenarion Circle, some of which have fallen to the silithid. I need you to retrieve some Druidical Remains from the silithid that inhabit the environs of Hive'Regal in southeastern Silithus.",p="Have you returned already then, <class>, with what I sent you out to gather?",c="A job well done, <name>. I will imbue the essence of the remains into the brazier.\n\nNow all that is left is to go to the lower portion of Blackrock Spire, to the chamber where War Master Voone resides in Tazz'Alaor, and use the brazier to summon forth the corrupted spirit of my former cohort, Mor Grayhoof. He cannot rest until the amulet piece is taken from him.\n\nOh, by the way, I had some leftover bloodkelp from your trip to Alcaz Isle, so I made it into some potions for you. Take your pick!",r={ch={{22192,3,"Bloodkelp Elixir of Dodging",1,"inv_potion_52"},{22193,3,"Bloodkelp Elixir of Resistance",1,"inv_potion_21"}},xp=6600},k=true}]=],
[8987]=[=[{o="Retrieve a Brilliant Sword of Zealotry and return it to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain.",d="<class>, listen closely. Now that we have the location of the last amulet piece, we still need another component to suffuse the brazier with; something that will provide a focus strong enough to summon the remains of my deceased, former comrades.\n\nThe siblings, Jarien and Sothos, were believers in the way of the Scarlet Crusade. They aspired to knighthood within that vile organization. Go to Tyr's Hand in Eastern Plaguelands and retrieve a Brilliant Sword of Zealotry from the praetorians there.",p="Have you returned already then, <class>, with what I sent you out to gather?",c="A job well done, <name>. I will imbue the essence of the sword into the brazier.\n\nNow all that is left is to get into The Crimson Throne inside The Scarlet Bastion at Stratholme, and use the brazier to summon forth the remains of my former cohorts, Jarien and Sothos. Their souls have been twisted further by their possession of Valthalak's amulet piece and his spirit within.\n\nOh, by the way, I had some leftover bloodkelp from your trip to Alcaz Isle, so I made it into some potions for you. Take your pick!",r={ch={{22192,3,"Bloodkelp Elixir of Dodging",1,"inv_potion_52"},{22193,3,"Bloodkelp Elixir of Resistance",1,"inv_potion_21"}},xp=6600},k=true}]=],
[8988]=[=[{o="Obtain Soul Ashes of the Banished and return them to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain.",d="<class>, listen closely. Now that we have the location of the last amulet piece, we still need another component to suffuse the brazier with; something that will provide a focus strong enough to entice the spirit of my deceased, former comrade.\n\nAn ogre necromancer that traveled with us, Kormok, delighted in summoning forth the souls of the banished dead of Purgation Isle, off the south coast of the Hillsbrad Foothills. Go there and retrieve some Soul Ashes of the Banished from their remains.",p="Have you returned already then, <class>, with what I sent you out to gather?",c="A job well done, <name>. I will imbue the essence of the ashes into the brazier.\n\nNow all that is left is to get into Scholomance, to Ras Frostwhisper's chamber, and use the brazier to summon forth the spirit of my former cohort, Kormok. The amulet piece, and Valthalak's spirit within, has corrupted him even further, and he will not rest until you forcibly take it from him.\n\nOh, by the way, I had some leftover bloodkelp from your trip to Alcaz Isle, so I made it into some potions for you. Take your pick!",r={ch={{22192,3,"Bloodkelp Elixir of Dodging",1,"inv_potion_52"},{22193,3,"Bloodkelp Elixir of Resistance",1,"inv_potion_21"}},xp=6600},k=true}]=],
[8994]=[=[{o="Gather 40 Blackrock Bracers and acquire a Flask of Supreme Power. Return them to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain.",n={{"Blackrock Bracer",40}},d="We're nearly there, <class>. All that is left is to retrieve a few more components so that I can attune the brazier and enable it to beckon forth Lord Valthalak.\n\nTo begin I must ask you to journey forth into Blackrock Spire and slay the orcs therein. They wear bracers that contain trace metals that I will need, so I'll need more than a few to extract the right amount out of them. Then, to complete the imbuing process, you'll need to bring me a Flask of Supreme Power.\n\nGood luck, <name>!",p="We've come a long way, <name>, and I just wanted to say that no matter what happens, thank you! You've put yourself in mortal danger to try to help the surviving members of our mercenary company, The Veiled Blade, and as far as I'm concerned, you're one of us now.",c="That's it then. I'll extract the metal from the bracers and imbue the brazier with these final components. Then it will be ready for you to summon Lord Valthalak, and finally return his spirit amulet to him.\n\nYou've come quite a distance, <name>, don't falter now that the end is in sight!",r={m=19800,xp=6600},k=true}]=],
[8996]=[=[{o="Return to Bodley inside Blackrock Mountain and give him the Brazier of Beckoning.",d="I will ignore your impertinence this time, <class>, because you have done a noble thing today; returning the rest of my stolen spirit to me. Despite your obviously weak nature, <race>, you have shown courage where those that stole from me did not, and probably never could!\n\nReturn to them, before I change my mind and slay you where you stand. Go back and tell them that they are safe... for now.",p="<name>, you're back and still alive! Well, at least that makes one of us.\n\nYou're going to have to tell me all about it!",c="He really said all of that? Wow, I can't believe he's going to call off the spectral assassins and stalkers, even if he did hint at causing my living companions further harm in the future.\n\nThis is a great day, <name>! You've accomplished what few ever could, and absolved us, at least in part, of some of our past sins.\n\nThank you! As a sign of appreciation, I'd like to give you this. You can use it to summon forth spirits at the same haunted locations that you already have, and a few others, too.",r={it={{22057,1,"Brazier of Invocation",1,"inv_misc_enggizmos_23"},{22344,1,"Brazier of Invocation: User's Manual",1,"inv_misc_book_09"}},xp=650},k=true}]=],
[8997]=[=[{o="Speak with Deliana at The High Seat in Ironforge.",d="I suppose that this is goodbye then, my friend. But, I'll always be here if you want to come back and talk with me from time to time. Probably while you're loitering around waiting for your buddies to join you for a raid on Blackrock Spire.\n\nGo, before I start to cry. Go back to Deliana in Ironforge and tell her what's happened.",c="I am very happy to see you return to me safely, <name>. You look well, if not a bit worse for the wear.\n\nCome, tell me of all that has transpired.",r={xp=650},k=true}]=],
[8999]=[=[{o="Give Deliana your Wildheart Cowl and Wildheart Vest.",d="That's an amazing story, <name>! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved. Now maybe I'll be able to sleep at night with both eyes shut.\n\nAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you'll really enjoy.",p="As per our deal, are you ready to hand over your Wildheart pieces in exchange for your new Feralheart Cowl and Vest?",c="I'm going to miss you, <name>. I owe you such a debt of gratitude; I think I'll never be able to repay it.\n\nI hope that you enjoy your new head and chest armor, and that it protects you for a long time to come.",r={it={{22109,1,"Feralheart Cowl",4,"inv_helmet_27"},{22113,1,"Feralheart Vest",4,"inv_chest_plate06"}}},k=true}]=],
[9000]=[=[{o="Give Deliana your Beaststalker's Cap and Beaststalker's Tunic.",d="That's an amazing story, <name>! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved. Now maybe I'll be able to sleep at night with both eyes shut.\n\nAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you'll really enjoy.",p="As per our deal, are you ready to hand over your Beaststalker pieces in exchange for your new Beastmaster's Cap and Tunic?",c="I'm going to miss you, <name>. I owe you such a debt of gratitude; I think I'll never be able to repay it.\n\nI hope that you enjoy your new head and chest armor, and that it protects you for a long time to come.",r={it={{22013,1,"Beastmaster's Cap",4,"inv_helmet_24"},{22060,1,"Beastmaster's Tunic",4,"inv_chest_chain_03"}}},k=true}]=],
[9001]=[=[{o="Give Deliana your Magister's Crown and Magister's Robes.",d="That's an amazing story, <name>! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved. Now maybe I'll be able to sleep at night with both eyes shut.\n\nAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you'll really enjoy.",p="As per our deal, are you ready to hand over your Magister's pieces in exchange for your new Sorcerer's Crown and Robes?",c="I'm going to miss you, <name>. I owe you such a debt of gratitude; I think I'll never be able to repay it.\n\nI hope that you enjoy your new head and chest armor, and that it protects you for a long time to come.",r={it={{22065,1,"Sorcerer's Crown",4,"inv_crown_02"},{22069,1,"Sorcerer's Robes",4,"inv_chest_cloth_25"}}},k=true}]=],
[9002]=[=[{o="Give Deliana your Lightforge Helm and Lightforge Breastplate.",d="That's an amazing story, <name>! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved. Now maybe I'll be able to sleep at night with both eyes shut.\n\nAs to your reward, I believe I have a few things that you'll really enjoy.",p="As per our deal, are you ready to hand over your Lightforge pieces in exchange for your new Soulforge Helmet and Breastplate?",c="I'm going to miss you, <name>. I owe you such a debt of gratitude; I think I'll never be able to repay it.\n\nI hope that you enjoy your new head and chest armor, and that it protects you for a long time to come.",r={it={{22091,1,"Soulforge Helm",4,"inv_helmet_08"},{22089,1,"Soulforge Breastplate",4,"inv_chest_plate03"}}},k=true}]=],
